     "type": "reasoning",
     "text": "**Initiating Full Implementation**\n\nI'm now fully immersed in the `tdd` implementation of the API routes detailed in `specs/M1-grade.md`, tackling them concurrently with their corresponding tests. My focus will be on the complete front-end development, specifically constructing the HTML, CSS, and JS components for M1, with an emphasis on the daily schedule/programming display.\n\n\n",
     "time": {
      "start": 1789502109538,
      "end": 1789502110403
     },
     "id": "prt_0a6a33762001m3hngxuUlza6YR",
